## Summary

Part of #63 (Hunter). There is no Hunter content on `main`. This adds the `content/skills/hunter` module with the Hunter techniques below. It is opened as a draft because most of it has not been checked in game on this commit.

In this PR:
- Bird snares and box traps: lay, wait, catch or lose the trap; five birds, ferrets, embertailed jerboas, grey/red/black chinchompas; trap limit by level; Check, Dismantle, Reset and Investigate.
- Bird house trapping on Fossil Island: four spaces, build, seeds, empty and reset, nests.
- Herbiboar tracking on Fossil Island, driven by the client's own trail varbits so RuneLite's Herbiboar plugin works; tunnel, stun and harvest.
- Butterfly and moth netting with butterfly jars and Release effects.
- Implings: catching with a net or barehanded, jar loot, crystal implings in Prifddinas.
- Hunters' Rumours: the Burrow's guild hunters, Guild Scribe Verity, rare parts with pity, turn-in, the quetzal whistle's Rumour op, Gilman's shop.

Not in this PR: Razor-backed kebbit tracking, deadfalls, net traps, falconry, drift nets, pitfalls, and the items listed under Not done below.

