## How it was tested

- Compile and `spotlessCheck` of `content:skills:hunter` and `content:skills:hunter:pack`, and `fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check`, run locally on this commit.
- No tests are in this PR.
- Not verified in game on this commit. Bird snares and box traps (lay, catch, Check) and the Hunters' Rumours dialogues were checked on the Android device on earlier builds of the same code. Bird houses, Herbiboar, butterflies, implings and the crystal impling spawn have not been played through in game.
- The same code had integration suites passing on fork branches (traps 7, bird houses 11, butterflies 7, Herbiboar 5, implings 14, Hunters' Rumours 12); those test files are left out of this PR and not re-run on this commit.

